<title>USA: Big Flower prices 10-3/4 notes.</title>
<headline>Big Flower prices 10-3/4 notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Big Flower Press Holdings Inc said Wednesday it has priced its outstanding 10 3/4 percent senior subordinated notes due 2003.</p>
<p>The company said total consideration for each $1,000 principal amount of notes tendered will be $1,081.09, based on an assumed payment date of July 24, 1997.</p>
<p>The offer expires July 23, unless extended, the company said.</p>
